DRAFT - FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION

WHEREAS the Certificate of Incorporation has been issued by Corporations Canada under the Canada Business Corporations Act;

RESOLVED, that the Articles of Incorporation and the by-laws of the Corporation are hereby approved, ratified, and adopted;

RESOLVED, that an aggregate of [NUMBER] common shares be allotted and issued to the incorporators at [AMOUNT] per share, fully paid, non-assessable, and credited as paid;

RESOLVED, that the registered office shall be situated at [STREET ADDRESS], [CITY], [PROVINCE], and the corporate records shall be maintained at such address;

RESOLVED, that [NAME] is appointed Chief Executive Officer and [NAME] is appointed Chief Financial Officer and Corporate Secretary;

RESOLVED, that banking resolutions be passed authorizing the opening, operation, and management of corporate bank accounts;

RESOLVED, that management is authorized to execute routine regulatory filings and incidental transactions.
